<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">type</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'object'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">properties</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">      </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">url</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">type</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'string'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">description</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'The URL to fetch'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">      </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">priority</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">type</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'string'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-kr">enum</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">[</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'high'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'low'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'auto'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">]</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">required</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">[</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'url'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">],</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">execute</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">async</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">({</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">url</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">priority</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">signal</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">})</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span>&gt;<span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// Abort the fetch request when tool execution is aborted.</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">response</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">fetch</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">url</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">priority</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">signal</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">stream</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">response</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">body</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">pipeThrough</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-ow">new</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">TextDecoderStream</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">());</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">for</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">chunk</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">of</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">stream</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">)</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">      </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">querySelector</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'pre'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">).</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">textContent</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">+=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">chunk</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">;</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">}</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">    </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">return</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'Success'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">;</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<h2 data-text="探索各类工具" id="discover-tools" tabindex="-1">探索各类工具</h2>

<p>使用 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">document.modelContext.getTools()</code> 检索可用工具。此异步方法会返回调用文档有权访问的工具列表，按字母顺序排序。</p>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">[</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">tool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">]</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">getTools</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">();</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-nx">console</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">log</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">tool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">);</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// {</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   annotations: { consequentialHint: false, debugging: false, readOnlyHint: false, untrustedContentHint: true }, // Optional hints</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   description: "Add a new item to the to-do list",</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   inputSchema: {"type":"object","properties":{…}},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   name: "addTodo",</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   origin: "https://example.com",</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   title: ""</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">//   window: Window {window: Window, self: Window, …},</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// }</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<p>默认情况下，<code dir="ltr" translate="no">getTools()</code> 仅返回由调用文档或框架树中其他同源文档注册的同源工具。如需检索跨域工具，您必须在 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">fromOrigins</code> 选项中明确列出其来源。此数组仅支持安全来源。</p>

<p>只有在满足以下条件时，系统才会添加来自跨域文档的工具：</p>

<ol>
<li>托管来源列在 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">fromOrigins</code> 选项中。</li>
<li>该工具已明确<a href="#origin-exposure">向您的源公开</a>。</li>
</ol>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// https://example.com</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// Get same-origin tools only</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">sameOriginTools</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">getTools</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">();</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// Get same-origin tools plus tools from specific cross-origin documents</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">allTools</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">getTools</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">({</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">fromOrigins</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">[</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'https://partner.org'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">]</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<p>如需查看如何从 iframe 检索工具并在基于 Web 的聊天界面中执行这些工具的示例，请参阅 <a href="https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/webmcp-tools/tree/main/demos/page-agent">WebMCP 页面智能体演示</a>。
请参阅<a href="https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/webmcp-extension/">示例 WebMCP 扩展程序</a>，了解浏览器扩展程序中的智能体如何跨同源和跨域 iframe 查找并运行工具。</p>

<h2 data-text="执行工具" id="execute_tool" tabindex="-1">执行工具</h2>

<p>如需手动执行在 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">getTools()</code> 中发现的工具，请调用 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">document.modelContext.executeTool()</code>，并传入一个可选的 JavaScript 对象作为输入参数，该对象可序列化为 JSON 字符串。此异步方法会返回工具执行的结果，或者在触发导航时返回 null。</p>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">result</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">executeTool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">tool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">text</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s2">"Buy milk"</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-nx">console</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">log</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">result</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">);</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// 'Added to-do: Buy milk'</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<p>您可以将 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">AbortSignal</code> 作为可选参数传递，以取消待执行的工具。</p>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-kd">const</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">controller</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-ow">new</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">AbortController</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">();</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">executeTool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">tool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">text</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s2">"Buy milk"</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">signal</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">controller</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">signal</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// Cancel tool execution later...</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-nx">controller</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">abort</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">();</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code><aside class="note"><strong>注意</strong>：<span> 从 Chrome 155 开始，JSON 字符串化输入参数已弃用。</span></aside>
<h2 data-text="事件" id="events" tabindex="-1">事件</h2>

<p>框架可以监听 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">document.modelContext</code> 上的 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">toolchange</code> 事件，以便在可用工具列表发生更改时收到通知。</p>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">addEventListener</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s2">"toolchange"</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">(</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">event</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">)</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">=</span>&gt;<span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// Tools have changed.</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<h2 data-text="跨源 iframe" id="cross-origin_iframes" tabindex="-1">跨源 iframe</h2>

<p>WebMCP 支持同时使用权限政策和显式源限制的跨域 iframe。</p>

<h3 data-text="“权限”政策" id="permissions_policy" tabindex="-1">“权限”政策</h3>

<p>默认情况下，跨源 iframe 中会停用工具注册。网页必须使用 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">tools</code>
<a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/privacy-security/permissions-policy?hl=zh-cn">Permissions Policy</a> 委托访问权限：</p>
<div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="HTML"><code translate="no" dir="ltr">&lt;iframe src="https://example.com" allow="tools"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<h3 data-text="源站暴露" id="origin-exposure" tabindex="-1">源站暴露</h3>

<p>默认情况下，工具不适用于跨域文档。您可以在 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">registerTool</code> 中使用 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">exposedTo</code> 数组，列出允许查看和执行工具的特定来源。此数组仅支持安全来源。</p>
<aside class="note"><strong>注意</strong>：<span> 即使某个工具已向您的源公开，您仍必须使用 <a href="#discover-tools"><code dir="ltr" translate="no">getTools()</code></a> 中的 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">fromOrigins</code> 选项，明确向托管源请求该工具。</span></aside><div></div><devsite-code><pre class="devsite-click-to-copy" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded syntax="JavaScript"><code translate="no" dir="ltr"><span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// https://partner.org</span>

<span class="devsite-syntax-k">await</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nb">document</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">modelContext</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">.</span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">registerTool</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">({</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">name</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'my_shared_tool'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">description</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'Shared across origins'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">,</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-c1">// ...</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-p">},</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">{</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-w">  </span><span class="devsite-syntax-nx">exposedTo</span><span class="devsite-syntax-o">:</span><span class="devsite-syntax-w"> </span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">[</span><span class="devsite-syntax-s1">'https://example.com'</span><span class="devsite-syntax-p">]</span>
<span class="devsite-syntax-p">});</span>
</code></pre></devsite-code>
<h2 data-text="React 支持" id="react_support" tabindex="-1">React 支持</h2>

<p>React <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/use-webmcp-tool">对 WebMCP 提供实验性支持</a>，使用的是 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">use-webmcp-tool</code> 软件包。如果您的应用已使用 React 编写，则可以使用与组件的装载和卸载生命周期相关联的 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">useWebMCP</code> 钩子来注册工具。它还支持条件工具注册，并会自动对执行结果进行归一化。</p>

<h2 data-text="Angular 支持" id="angular_support" tabindex="-1">Angular 支持</h2>

<p>Angular <a href="https://angular.dev/ai/webmcp">以实验性功能的形式支持 WebMCP</a>。
如果您的应用已使用 Angular 编写，您可以注册与应用的依赖项注入生命周期相关联的工具，并将 Signal Forms 转换为 WebMCP 工具。</p>

<h2 data-text="Vue 支持" id="vue_support" tabindex="-1">Vue 支持</h2>

<p>Vue 通过 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">@vueuse/core</code> 软件包<a href="https://vueuse.org/core/usewebmcp">对 WebMCP 提供实验性支持</a>。如果您的应用已使用 Vue 编写，则可以使用与当前 Vue 范围生命周期关联的 <code dir="ltr" translate="no">useWebMCP</code> 可组合项注册工具。它还支持响应式和条件式工具注册，并会自动对执行结果进行标准化。</p>

<h2 data-text="互动和分享反馈" id="engage_and_share_feedback" tabindex="-1">互动和分享反馈</h2>

<p>WebMCP 正在积极讨论中，未来可能会发生变化。如果您试用此 API 并有反馈，我们非常期待收到您的反馈。</p>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/webmachinelearning/webmcp?tab=readme-ov-file">阅读 WebMCP 说明</a>，提出问题并参与讨论。</li>
<li>了解如何<a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/build-tools?hl=zh-cn">构建有效的 WebMCP 工具</a>以及 <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/best-practices?hl=zh-cn">WebMCP 最佳实践</a>。</li>
<li>在 <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5117755740913664">Chrome 状态</a>中查看 Chrome 的实现。</li>
<li><a href="http://goo.gle/chrome-ai-dev-preview-join">加入早期预览计划</a>，抢先体验新 API 并加入我们的邮寄名单。</li>
<li>如果您对 Chrome 的实现有任何反馈，请提交 <a href="https://crbug.com/new?component=2021259">Chromium 错误</a>。</li>
</ul>

  

  

  
</div>
